{"about_the_game":"Nurture a small pot of succulents that grow in real time. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nViridi is a safe haven, a place you can return to for a moment of peace and quiet whenever you need it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLeave Viridi open in a second window to keep you company while you work, or check in on your plants as a meditative moment every night. While not fully realistic (they're very forgiving), your succulents will require some maintenance and can die from over- or under-watering. Name your favorite plants, give them special care and attention, and they might even flower for you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nViridi is free to try and comes with your choice of plant assortments. If you think it has a place in your life, you can buy your favorite plants from the in-game nursery for just a few cents a piece. Remember to visit the nursery occasionally for the weekly free seeding!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aeonium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/c22cb7411fae5bd2b1b2a89f8dfeb3c46c5060ce.jpg"},{"name":"Echeveria glauca","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/40a8cf421081ca3eec7f7fa1507295237fc96da8.jpg"},{"name":"Pachyphytum fittkaui","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/76a2f8d49e33354f25a1285ff2c7ad83d8f36046.jpg"},{"name":"Aloe vera","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/f511edceb65fa3bde09936626545e132a843840f.jpg"},{"name":"Pachyphytum glutinicaule","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/225c055d6dcac99917b9d25b8b14b66574634f8a.jpg"},{"name":"Pachyphytum hookeri","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/77574fa98b18c9ac466a1867bc49e01e67e65859.jpg"},{"name":"Sempervivum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/375950/16c148b44f7933071892e326a1